#: ../../source/index.rst:7
msgid ""
"<div class=\"cavise-home\">\n"
"  <section class=\"cavise-hero\">\n"
"    <div class=\"cavise-hero__eyebrow\">Connected & Automated Vehicle Integrated Simulation "
"Environment</div>\n"
"    <h1 class=\"cavise-hero__title\">Build, run, and inspect cooperative driving scenarios.</h1>\n"
"    <p class=\"cavise-hero__lead\">\n"
"      CAVISE documentation brings together operational guides for OpenCDA, Artery, SUMO, and "
"CARLA.\n"
"    </p>\n"
"    <div class=\"cavise-chip-row\">\n"
"      <span class=\"cavise-chip\">OpenCDA</span>\n"
"      <span class=\"cavise-chip\">Artery</span>\n"
"      <span class=\"cavise-chip\">SUMO</span>\n"
"      <span class=\"cavise-chip\">CARLA</span>\n"
"    </div>\n"
"    <div class=\"cavise-hero__actions\">\n"
"      <a class=\"cavise-home-link cavise-home-link--primary\" href=\"getting-started/first-"
"simulation.html\">First Simulation</a>\n"
"      <a class=\"cavise-home-link\" href=\"wiki/install-and-launch.html\">Installation</a>\n"
"    </div>\n"
"  </section>\n"
"\n"
"  <section class=\"cavise-home-grid\">\n"
"    <a class=\"cavise-card\" href=\"wiki/install-and-launch.html\">\n"
"      <div class=\"cavise-card__eyebrow\">Guides</div>\n"
"      <h2 class=\"cavise-card__title\">Installation</h2>\n"
"      <p class=\"cavise-card__text\">Prepare Linux or Windows/WSL2, Docker, GPU access and "
"component repositories.</p>\n"
"    </a>\n"
"    <a class=\"cavise-card\" href=\"scenarios/index.html\">\n"
"      <div class=\"cavise-card__eyebrow\">Workflows</div>\n"
"      <h2 class=\"cavise-card__title\">Scenario Creation</h2>\n"
"      <p class=\"cavise-card__text\">Prepare YAML, SUMO assets, Artery configs, and coordinate "
"data for new scenarios.</p>\n"
"    </a>\n"
"    <a class=\"cavise-card\" href=\"guides/advcp.html\">\n"
"      <div class=\"cavise-card__eyebrow\">Security Experiments</div>\n"
"      <h2 class=\"cavise-card__title\">Run AdvCP</h2>\n"
"      <p class=\"cavise-card__text\">Run a matched perception baseline and attack, then inspect "
"predictions and metrics.</p>\n"
"    </a>\n"
"    <a class=\"cavise-card\" href=\"models.html\">\n"
"      <div class=\"cavise-card__eyebrow\">Runtime Assets</div>\n"
"      <h2 class=\"cavise-card__title\">Models</h2>\n"
"      <p class=\"cavise-card__text\">Fetch individual OpenCOOD checkpoints and AdvCP asset "
"bundles when they are needed.</p>\n"
"    </a>\n"
"    <a class=\"cavise-card\" href=\"wiki/troubleshooting.html\">\n"
"      <div class=\"cavise-card__eyebrow\">Support</div>\n"
"      <h2 class=\"cavise-card__title\">Troubleshooting</h2>\n"
"      <p class=\"cavise-card__text\">Resolve common CARLA, OpenCDA, and Artery runtime issues "
"from one place.</p>\n"
"    </a>\n"
"    <a class=\"cavise-card\" href=\"wiki/additional-scripts.html\">\n"
"      <div class=\"cavise-card__eyebrow\">Tooling</div>\n"
"      <h2 class=\"cavise-card__title\">Utility Scripts</h2>\n"
"      <p class=\"cavise-card__text\">Inspect coordinates, convert CARLA maps and turn perception "
"frames into videos.</p>\n"
"    </a>\n"
"  </section>\n"
"\n"
"  <section class=\"cavise-section-panel\">\n"
"    <h2>Platform at a glance</h2>\n"
"    <div class=\"cavise-stack-grid\">\n"
"      <div class=\"cavise-stack-item\">\n"
"        <strong>Environment Setup</strong>\n"
"        <span>Install once, then follow a bounded CARLA and OpenCDA first simulation.</span>\n"
"      </div>\n"
"      <div class=\"cavise-stack-item\">\n"
"        <strong>Scenario Authoring</strong>\n"
"        <span>YAML configuration, SUMO assets, `.net.xml`, `.poly.xml`, and Artery scenario "
"files.</span>\n"
"      </div>\n"
"      <div class=\"cavise-stack-item\">\n"
"        <strong>Operational Support</strong>\n"
"        <span>Connection, map, GPU, model and co-simulation diagnostics.</span>\n"
"      </div>\n"
"      <div class=\"cavise-stack-item\">\n"
"        <strong>Security Experiments</strong>\n"
"        <span>Compare baseline and attacked perception, or configure attacks against behavior "
"services.</span>\n"
"      </div>\n"
"    </div>\n"
"  </section>\n"
"</div>"
msgstr ""
"<div class=\"cavise-home\">\n"
"  <section class=\"cavise-hero\">\n"
"    <div class=\"cavise-hero__eyebrow\">Connected & Automated Vehicle Integrated Simulation "
"Environment</div>\n"
"    <h1 class=\"cavise-hero__title\">Создавайте, запускайте и исследуйте сценарии кооперативного "
"вождения.</h1>\n"
"    <p class=\"cavise-hero__lead\">\n"
"      Документация CAVISE объединяет практические руководства по OpenCDA, Artery, SUMO и CARLA.\n"
"    </p>\n"
"    <div class=\"cavise-chip-row\">\n"
"      <span class=\"cavise-chip\">OpenCDA</span>\n"
"      <span class=\"cavise-chip\">Artery</span>\n"
"      <span class=\"cavise-chip\">SUMO</span>\n"
"      <span class=\"cavise-chip\">CARLA</span>\n"
"    </div>\n"
"    <div class=\"cavise-hero__actions\">\n"
"      <a class=\"cavise-home-link cavise-home-link--primary\" href=\"getting-started/first-"
"simulation.html\">Первая симуляция</a>\n"
"      <a class=\"cavise-home-link\" href=\"wiki/install-and-launch.html\">Установка</a>\n"
"    </div>\n"
"  </section>\n"
"\n"
"  <section class=\"cavise-home-grid\">\n"
"    <a class=\"cavise-card\" href=\"wiki/install-and-launch.html\">\n"
"      <div class=\"cavise-card__eyebrow\">Руководства</div>\n"
"      <h2 class=\"cavise-card__title\">Установка</h2>\n"
"      <p class=\"cavise-card__text\">Подготовьте Linux или Windows/WSL2, Docker, доступ к GPU и "
"репозитории компонентов.</p>\n"
"    </a>\n"
"    <a class=\"cavise-card\" href=\"scenarios/index.html\">\n"
"      <div class=\"cavise-card__eyebrow\">Рабочие процессы</div>\n"
"      <h2 class=\"cavise-card__title\">Создание сценария</h2>\n"
"      <p class=\"cavise-card__text\">Подготовьте YAML, ресурсы SUMO, конфигурации Artery и данные"
" координат для новых сценариев.</p>\n"
"    </a>\n"
"    <a class=\"cavise-card\" href=\"guides/advcp.html\">\n"
"      <div class=\"cavise-card__eyebrow\">Эксперименты по безопасности</div>\n"
"      <h2 class=\"cavise-card__title\">Запуск AdvCP</h2>\n"
"      <p class=\"cavise-card__text\">Выполните сопоставимые базовый запуск и атаку, затем изучите"
" прогнозы и метрики.</p>\n"
"    </a>\n"
"    <a class=\"cavise-card\" href=\"models.html\">\n"
"      <div class=\"cavise-card__eyebrow\">Ресурсы времени выполнения</div>\n"
"      <h2 class=\"cavise-card__title\">Модели</h2>\n"
"      <p class=\"cavise-card__text\">Загружайте отдельные чекпойнты OpenCOOD и пакеты ресурсов "
"AdvCP по мере необходимости.</p>\n"
"    </a>\n"
"    <a class=\"cavise-card\" href=\"wiki/troubleshooting.html\">\n"
"      <div class=\"cavise-card__eyebrow\">Поддержка</div>\n"
"      <h2 class=\"cavise-card__title\">Устранение неполадок</h2>\n"
"      <p class=\"cavise-card__text\">Устраняйте распространённые проблемы времени выполнения "
"CARLA, OpenCDA и Artery в одном разделе.</p>\n"
"    </a>\n"
"    <a class=\"cavise-card\" href=\"wiki/additional-scripts.html\">\n"
"      <div class=\"cavise-card__eyebrow\">Инструменты</div>\n"
"      <h2 class=\"cavise-card__title\">Вспомогательные скрипты</h2>\n"
"      <p class=\"cavise-card__text\">Проверяйте координаты, преобразуйте карты CARLA и создавайте"
" видео из кадров восприятия.</p>\n"
"    </a>\n"
"  </section>\n"
"\n"
"  <section class=\"cavise-section-panel\">\n"
"    <h2>Краткий обзор платформы</h2>\n"
"    <div class=\"cavise-stack-grid\">\n"
"      <div class=\"cavise-stack-item\">\n"
"        <strong>Настройка среды</strong>\n"
"        <span>Выполните установку один раз, а затем запустите ограниченную первую симуляцию CARLA"
" и OpenCDA.</span>\n"
"      </div>\n"
"      <div class=\"cavise-stack-item\">\n"
"        <strong>Создание сценариев</strong>\n"
"        <span>Конфигурация YAML, ресурсы SUMO, `.net.xml`, `.poly.xml` и файлы сценариев "
"Artery.</span>\n"
"      </div>\n"
"      <div class=\"cavise-stack-item\">\n"
"        <strong>Эксплуатационная поддержка</strong>\n"
"        <span>Диагностика подключения, карт, GPU, моделей и совместной симуляции.</span>\n"
"      </div>\n"
"      <div class=\"cavise-stack-item\">\n"
"        <strong>Эксперименты по безопасности</strong>\n"
"        <span>Сравнивайте восприятие без атаки и при атаке или настраивайте атаки на сервисы "
"поведения.</span>\n"
"      </div>\n"
"    </div>\n"
"  </section>\n"
"</div>"

